  "body_html": "<p>So, it's <em>that</em> time of the year, if you live in Europe: <strong>Eurovision!</strong> It's the world's oldest and largest song competition — that people either love, hate or love/hate!</p>\n\n<p>I watched the first semifinal yesterday, and was actually blown away by the graphic design this year. Really nice, animated gradients — and a very vibrant color palette.</p>\n\n<p>But … then I went to the <a href=\"https://eurovision.tv/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">official website</a>, and saw a 4.6 megabyte pixelated, sad looking animated gradient! Why? When we can easily do animated gradients in CSS?</p>\n\n<p>Let's dive in.</p>\n\n<h2>\n  <a name=\"recreating-the-gradients\" href=\"#recreating-the-gradients\">\n  </a>\n  Re-creating the gradients\n</h2>\n\n<p>If you look at the gradients — or if you watched the show — you'll notice it's basically a grid with columns that span between 1—8.<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nc\">.eurovision</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">aspect-ratio</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">4</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">container-type</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">inline-size</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">display</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">grid</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">grid-auto-flow</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">column</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">position</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">relative</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">width</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">100%</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>Now, for the columns, we'll create a bunch of <code>&lt;b&gt;</code>-tags (can be any tag, basically), and add some CSS:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nt\">b</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">animation</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Y</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--animdur</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">5s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--animdel</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">0s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--animtf</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">linear</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"n\">infinite</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">background</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">repeating-linear-gradient</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--deg</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">0deg</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--c1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"no\">orange</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--c2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"no\">hotpink</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--c3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"no\">yellow</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--c2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"no\">hotpink</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--c1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"no\">orange</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">background-size</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">100%</span> <span class=\"m\">500%</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">display</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">block</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>The animation simply moves the Y-position of the background:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"k\">@keyframes</span> <span class=\"n\">Y</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">to</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"py\">background-position-y</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">250%</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>To create some variation, we change the <code>animation-delay</code> for the <code>&lt;b&gt;</code>-tags, based on their <code>nth-of-type</code>:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nt\">b</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"err\">&amp;:nth-of-type(1)</span> <span class=\"err\">{</span> <span class=\"py\">--animdel</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">50ms</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"nd\">:nth-of-type</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"err\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"py\">--animdel</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">100ms</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"nd\">:nth-of-type</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"err\">3</span><span class=\"o\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"py\">--animdel</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">150ms</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"nd\">:nth-of-type</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"err\">4</span><span class=\"o\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"py\">--animdel</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">200ms</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"nd\">:nth-of-type</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"err\">5</span><span class=\"o\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"py\">--animdel</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">250ms</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"c\">/* etc. */</span>\n<span class=\"err\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>Finally, for the column-spans, we add some modifier-classes:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nc\">.span-2</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"nl\">grid-column</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">span</span> <span class=\"m\">2</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nc\">.span-3</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"nl\">grid-column</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">span</span> <span class=\"m\">3</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nc\">.span-4</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"nl\">grid-column</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">span</span> <span class=\"m\">4</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"c\">/* etc. */</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>Let's see how we're doing:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Ff6qax1jx9eet3xeu54mu.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Ff6qax1jx9eet3xeu54mu.png\" alt=\"yellow\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"199\"></a></p>\n\n<p>Vibrant! Now, because of the custom properties, we can just add a class with some updates to get the purple/pink-gradient:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nc\">.header</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">--c1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"no\">purple</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">--c2</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"no\">deeppink</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">--c3</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"no\">hotpink</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F29759yydwygs1x9fu03g.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F29759yydwygs1x9fu03g.png\" alt=\"Purple\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"198\"></a></p>\n\n<p>Nice! I added a gradient text as well:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nt\">h1</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">background</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">linear-gradient</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"m\">95deg</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"no\">yellow</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"no\">hotpink</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"no\">deeppink</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"no\">orange</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">background-clip</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">text</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">font-family</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"s1\">\"Hind\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">sans-serif</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">font-optical-sizing</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">auto</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">font-weight</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">500</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">font-style</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">normal</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">font-size</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">10</span><span class=\"n\">cqi</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">letter-spacing</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">-0.075ch</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">place-self</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">center</span> <span class=\"nb\">center</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">position</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">absolute</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">text-transform</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">uppercase</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">-webkit-text-fill-color</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">transparent</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>Now, for the red/blue-version, I took one of the nice <code>linear()</code> timing-functions from Adam Argyle's <a href=\"https://open-props.style/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open Props</a>:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nc\">.red-shift</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">--c1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"no\">red</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">--c2</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"no\">purple</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">--c3</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"no\">blue</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">--animtf</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span> <span class=\"m\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">.006</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">.025</span> <span class=\"m\">2.8%</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">.101</span> <span class=\"m\">6.1%</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">.539</span> <span class=\"m\">18.9%</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">.721</span> <span class=\"m\">25.3%</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">.849</span> <span class=\"m\">31.5%</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">.937</span> <span class=\"m\">38.1%</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">.968</span> <span class=\"m\">41.8%</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">.991</span> <span class=\"m\">45.7%</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">1.006</span> <span class=\"m\">50.1%</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">1.015</span> <span class=\"m\">55%</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">1.017</span> <span class=\"m\">63.9%</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">1.001</span> <span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>And we get:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fb0pbetm9ienr1y6kfvcx.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fb0pbetm9ienr1y6kfvcx.png\" alt=\"Red Shift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>And that's it! Remember to vote for your favorite song, and check out the CodePen here:</p>\n\n<p><iframe height=\"600\" src=\"https://codepen.io/stoumann/embed/dyEbejJ?height=600&amp;default-tab=result&amp;embed-version=2\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allowtransparency=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n</iframe>\n</p>\n\n",
  "body_markdown": "So, it's _that_ time of the year, if you live in Europe: **Eurovision!** It's the world's oldest and largest song competition — that people either love, hate or love/hate!\n\nI watched the first semifinal yesterday, and was actually blown away by the graphic design this year. Really nice, animated gradients — and a very vibrant color palette.\n\nBut … then I went to the [official website](https://eurovision.tv/), and saw a 4.6 megabyte pixelated, sad looking animated gradient! Why? When we can easily do animated gradients in CSS?\n\nLet's dive in.\n\n## Re-creating the gradients\n\nIf you look at the gradients — or if you watched the show — you'll notice it's basically a grid with columns that span between 1—8.\n\n```css\n.eurovision {\n  aspect-ratio: 4/1;\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-auto-flow: column;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n```\n\nNow, for the columns, we'll create a bunch of `<b>`-tags (can be any tag, basically), and add some CSS:\n\n```css\nb {\n  animation: Y var(--animdur, 5s) var(--animdel, 0s) var(--animtf, linear) infinite;\n  background: repeating-linear-gradient(var(--deg, 0deg), var(--c1, orange), var(--c2, hotpink), var(--c3, yellow), var(--c2, hotpink), var(--c1, orange));\n  background-size: 100% 500%;\n  display: block;\n}\n```\n\nThe animation simply moves the Y-position of the background:\n\n```css\n@keyframes Y {\n  to { background-position-y: 250%; }\n}\n```\n\nTo create some variation, we change the `animation-delay` for the `<b>`-tags, based on their `nth-of-type`:\n\n```css\nb {\n  &:nth-of-type(1) { --animdel: 50ms; }\n  &:nth-of-type(2) { --animdel: 100ms; }\n  &:nth-of-type(3) { --animdel: 150ms; }\n  &:nth-of-type(4) { --animdel: 200ms; }\n  &:nth-of-type(5) { --animdel: 250ms; }\n  /* etc. */\n}\n```\n\nFinally, for the column-spans, we add some modifier-classes:\n\n```css\n.span-2 { grid-column: span 2; }\n.span-3 { grid-column: span 3; }\n.span-4 { grid-column: span 4; }\n/* etc. */\n```\n\nLet's see how we're doing:\n\n![yellow](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/f6qax1jx9eet3xeu54mu.png)\n\nVibrant! Now, because of the custom properties, we can just add a class with some updates to get the purple/pink-gradient:\n\n```css\n.header {\n  --c1: purple;\n  --c2: deeppink;\n  --c3: hotpink;\n}\n```\n\n![Purple](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/29759yydwygs1x9fu03g.png)\n\nNice! I added a gradient text as well:\n\n```css\nh1 {\n  background: linear-gradient(95deg, yellow, hotpink, deeppink, orange);\n  background-clip: text;\n  font-family: \"Hind\", sans-serif;\n  font-optical-sizing: auto;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-size: 10cqi;\n  letter-spacing: -0.075ch;\n  place-self: center center;\n  position: absolute;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n}\n```\n\nNow, for the red/blue-version, I took one of the nice `linear()` timing-functions from Adam Argyle's [Open Props](https://open-props.style/):\n\n```css\n.red-shift {\n  --c1:red;\n  --c2:purple;\n  --c3:blue;\n  --animtf:linear( 0, .006, .025 2.8%, .101 6.1%, .539 18.9%, .721 25.3%, .849 31.5%, .937 38.1%, .968 41.8%, .991 45.7%, 1.006 50.1%, 1.015 55%, 1.017 63.9%, 1.001 );\n}\n```\n\nAnd we get:\n\n![Red Shift](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/b0pbetm9ienr1y6kfvcx.png)\n\n---\n\nAnd that's it! Remember to vote for your favorite song, and check out the CodePen here:\n\n{% codepen https://codepen.io/stoumann/pen/dyEbejJ %}\n\n\n\n\n",
